# Each subdirectory here is a standalone test project — not tracked in the parent repo.
# Naming convention: testing/<round>/<project-slug>/
#   round:         round-01, round-02, ...
#   project-slug:  short kebab-case name for the idea being tested
#
# Example:
#   testing/round-01/invoice-tracker/
#   testing/round-01/habit-log/
#   testing/round-02/recipe-planner/

*
